## 🏗️ 3. ARCHITECTURE DÉCISIONS

### Pourquoi cette approche ?

**Option 1 : Monorepo (Nx/Turbo)** → 2 jours setup, trop pour 10j ❌
**Option 2 : Monolith React + Supabase Edge** → Choisi ✅

### Pattern: Odoc Clone

1. **Frontend** : React hooks + React Query (caching smart)
2. **Backend** : Supabase Edge Functions (Deno) + RLS
3. **IA** : Gemini Flash (cheap, fast) + Groq fallback
4. **Auth** : Supabase email (simplest, Odoc-proven)
5. **Deploy** : Lovable Cloud (auto-CI/CD, faster iterate)

### Pas de Nice-To-Haves
❌ Dark mode toggle (default dark, done)
❌ Notifications real-time (polling J8+ si temps)
❌ Analytics dashboards fancy (simple graphs OK)
❌ Mobile app (PWA suffix j10)
❌ Internationalization (FR only, EN in code comments)
❌ E-commerce payment flow (stub form J10)

