## ⚡ LAST TIPS FOR SUCCESS

1. **Commit early, commit often** (every 1-2h)
2. **Test on real device daily** (not just browser)
3. **Logs, logs, logs** (error tracking = lifesaver)
4. **Supabase console always open** (debug RLS, queries)
5. **Keep Lovable deploy green** (revert if broken)
6. **No heroics after 10pm** (tired code = bugs)
7. **Copy Odoc patterns** (don't reinvent wheel)
8. **Ask Claude "what could fail?"** before big features
9. **Beta testers ≠ Users** (test ≠ feedback)
10. **Ship fast, iterate faster** (MVP first, polish month 2)

